...
!anim re1 text {{color=warn|[a-zA-Z_]}}{{color=#9090FF|[a-zA-Z0-9_]}}+
...
!anim re1 text {{color=#9090FF|[a-zA-Z_]}}{{color=#9090FF|[a-zA-Z0-9_]}}+
!anim question text What would “{{color=math|**`i`**}}” match?
...
!anim re1 text {{color=#9090FF|[a-zA-Z_]}}{{color=#9090FF|[a-zA-Z0-9_]}}{{color=warn|*}}
