!anim re1 text {{color=#9090FF|[a-zA-Z_]}}{{color=#9090FF|[a-zA-Z0-9_]}}*
!anim question text What would “{{color=math|**`x-3`**}}” match?
...
!anim re2 text {{color=warn|[-+]?}}{{color=#9090FF|[0-9]}}+({{color=emp|\.}}{{color=#9090FF|[0-9]}}+)?
...
