### Project 1: Lexical Analysis
...
- Correctness is job #1.
...
  - And job #2 and #3!
...
- Remember that this project may be used in future projects.
...
- Tips on building large systems (such as our compiler):
...
  - Keep it simple
...
  - Design systems that can be tested
...
  - Don't optimize prematurely
...
  - It is easier to modify a working system than to get a system working
